cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released results, please cite the STRAT paper."
title: "STRAT: Spatio-Temporal Relational-Attention Transformer for Leakage-Free, Uncertainty-Aware Tourist Trajectory Forecasting"
authors:
  - name: "The STRAT Authors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LJH-CPU/STRAT"
type: software
abstract: >-
  STRAT is a leakage-free framework for uncertainty-aware tourist trajectory
  forecasting in scenic areas. It couples granular-ball spectral clustering for
  region/route discovery, a strict no-leakage evaluation protocol, a strictly
  causal relational graph, and a joint next-region + probabilistic arrival-time
  model calibrated at both segment and path level.
keywords:
  - trajectory forecasting
  - next-location prediction
  - arrival-time prediction
  - granular-ball clustering
  - transformer
  - leakage-free evaluation
